# Cancel the calls in progress of a request (docs/INTERPRETATION.md, Cancelling calls), for
# example when the dialogue that asked them has ended. Each of those calls returns at once with
# source "invalid" and fallback_reason "cancelled". Later calls are not affected.

string request_id           # the request_id of the calls to cancel
---
bool success                # false only if request_id is empty
int32 cancelled             # how many calls in progress were cancelled (0: none was)
string message
